License: other
 Each Python package in the environment keeps its own license, in its own
 *.dist-info directory under that path, and is summarised in
 /usr/share/doc/teaport-brain/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md. Two of them are
 LGPL-2.1-or-later: soxr (libsoxr, linked into its extension module) and libsndfile
 (the shared object in the soundfile package). THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md says where the
 source of the exact versions is, and how to replace either library.
